{"product_id":"nasty-burst-pineapple-kiwi-nic-salt","title":"Nasty Burst - Pineapple Kiwi Nic Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Burst Salt brings bold, bar-style flavor with a silky salt-nic formulation tuned for smooth MTL satisfaction. Crafted by Nasty Juice for refillable pods, Burst focuses on punchy top notes, clean sweetness, and a polished finish that stays consistent from first fill to last. If you’re upgrading from disposables or prefilled pods, this line keeps the flavor intensity you love while delivering the coil-friendly performance pods need day in, day out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you prefer frosty fruits, soda fizz, or dessert twists, Nasty Burst keeps each puff crisp and satisfying—perfect for commuting, nights out, or easy everyday carry across Kenya.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Burst Salt E-liquid Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: Nasty Juice\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCategory: Salt E-liquid\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30 ml\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrengths: 35 mg and 50 mg\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlend: 50% VG \/ 50% PG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-liquid Type: Nicotine salt for tight MTL use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLatest series of 2025\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":42024771485751,"sku":"Nasty Burst - Pineapple Kiwi 35 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42024771518519,"sku":"Nasty Burst - Pineapple Kiwi 50 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Burst-Salt-E-liquid-Pineapple-Kiwi.webp?v=1765941469","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-burst-pineapple-kiwi-nic-salt","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




